## Phase 4: Add Logout/Clear Key Functionality

**Issue**: User requested logout/clear key option in UI.

**Solution**:
1. Add logout button to header area (visible when authenticated)
2. Add clearKey() JavaScript function to remove 'mad_key' from localStorage
3. Reload page after clearing to return to unauthenticated state

**Implementation**:
- Add to index.html header area:
```html
{{if .Authenticated}}
<button onclick="logout()" style="...">Logout</button>
{{end}}
```

- Add JavaScript function:
```javascript
function logout() {
    if (confirm('Clear your saved key?')) {
        localStorage.removeItem('mad_key');
        // Clear URL params without reloading
        window.history.replaceState({}, '', window.location.pathname);
        location.reload();
    }
}
```

